stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> pending: schedule
  pending --> claimed: claim once
  pending --> cancelled: pause, stale input or deadline
  claimed --> completed: matching accepted_current result
  claimed --> cancelled: revalidation fails, or claimant cancels
  claimed --> claimed: reopen returns Existing
  cancelled --> [*]
  completed --> [*]
  note right of pending
    Schedule requires the exact current binding,
    a running task and an unexpired deadline.
  end note
  note left of claimed
    Revalidation fails on pause, non-running task,
    changed input or deadline. Reopen never sends twice.
  end note
